  "rhythmLadderCapRung": "Step {rung}: {days} days — and stay there",
  "rhythmLadderLengthen": "One day more",
  "rhythmLadderShorten": "One day less",
  "rhythmLadderAddRung": "Add a step",
  "rhythmLadderRemoveRung": "Remove this step",
  "rhythmLadderDescendingWarning": "The gaps get shorter again. The ladder is meant to stretch the longer a nest goes unused — this way round inverts that, and the server will not accept it.",
  "rhythmLadderBelowBaseWarning": "The first step is below the base interval of {base} days. An empty nest would then be checked more often than one with eggs in it. The server will not accept that.",
  "rhythmPerStepLabel": "Empty checks per step",
  "rhythmPerStepHelp": "This many empty checks in a row before the gap moves up one step.",
  "rhythmHalfClutchLabel": "Return visit after a half clutch",
  "rhythmHalfClutchHelp": "How long until the return visit when only part of a clutch could be swapped. Applies to new return visits — ones already planned keep their date, because a plan is a fact about a decision somebody made.",
